            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36711370?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">With <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1930501\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1930501</a> making the bfcache clearable programmatically from website context, it is now also partitioned within Firefox.</p>",
