        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The Deploy page recommends Glitch, which we're cleaning up from docs pages now. It makes more sense to remove the page and add the reading list to the last step of the tutorial.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Removals:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Deploy page</li>\n<li>Deprecated HTML metas</li>\n<li>Duplicate HTML metas &amp; copy-paste opengraph tags</li>\n<li>unused manifest.json</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Helping <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/chrisdavidmills/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/chrisdavidmills\">@chrisdavidmills</a> remove some of the Glitch assets.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3192002804\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40148\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40148/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40148\">#40148</a></li>\n</ul>",
