        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A few things:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Document <code class=\"notranslate\">colorType</code> for Canvas and OffscreenCanvas.</li>\n<li>Sync <code class=\"notranslate\">contextAttributes</code> to be exactly the same in <code class=\"notranslate\">getContext</code> methods for Canvas and OffscreenCanvas.</li>\n<li>List CanvasRenderingContext2D.getContextAttributes in the \"Context\" sections.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Up-to-date docs.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Explainer for colorType: <a href=\"https://github.com/ccameron-chromium/ColorWeb-CG/blob/canvas2d_float/canvas_float.md\">https://github.com/ccameron-chromium/ColorWeb-CG/blob/canvas2d_float/canvas_float.md</a><br>\nChromestatus: <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5086141338877952\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5086141338877952</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #37727.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2799353693\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37727\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/37727/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37727\">#37727</a><br>\n<span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #38087.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2842721747\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38087\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/38087/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38087\">#38087</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3192221691\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40149\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40149/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40149\">#40149</a></p>",
