        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Document floating-point pixel support in 2D canvas which ships in Chromium-based browsers as of v137.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I like to document the web platform.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Explainer: <a href=\"https://github.com/ccameron-chromium/ColorWeb-CG/blob/image_data_float/image_data_float.md\">https://github.com/ccameron-chromium/ColorWeb-CG/blob/image_data_float/image_data_float.md</a><br>\nChromestatus: <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5086141338877952\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5086141338877952</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39023.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2976672819\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39023\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39023/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39023\">#39023</a></p>",
