        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106619?u=40d955f343b2e591fc2d05816dd8e63904710cb3&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The section was largely outdated, referencing SCTP implementations that were not used and referencing issues from many years back that are no longer present on modern clients.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The new wording is not as detailed, but still motivates why an application should avoid sending very large messages.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The current documentation was outdated and simply not correct in the year 2025.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">N/A</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">N/A</p>",
