        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33990174?u=47f37dcad2f889fd26399d194ba571891b51fb15&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I edited the paragraph explaining postal code validation example. Switzerland was mentioned there as an example county but its county code wasn't, so I added it.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It was confusing, as from the text it seems that swiss country code is <code class=\"notranslate\">F-</code> but in reality it is <code class=\"notranslate\">CH-</code> (which is reflected correctly in the provided code).</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">None.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I didn't find a open issue that mentions this. This edit doesn't have dependencies.</p>",
