        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is a follow-up to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3161613173\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40001\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40001/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40001\">#40001</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Josh-Cena/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Josh-Cena\">@Josh-Cena</a> <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/hamishwillee/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/hamishwillee\">@hamishwillee</a> can you take look?<br>\nI think with the phrasing \"dangerous and discouraged\" in the para, we should ideally change the text into a \"Warning\" callout.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I've also rephrased the text to follow this format: \"though <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;this is possible&gt;</code>, don't do it <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;because&gt;</code>. always <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;do this&gt;</code>.\"</p>",
